build
*.log
# ...but the golden reference IS the artifact, not a build by-product. Without
# this negation "*.log" silently swallows it and docs/handshake/README.md points
# at a file that is not in the repository.
!docs/golden-reference.log
# Same trap, second time: rig-session logs are evidence a handshake lap cites,
# not build output. Caught because the commit that added them staged the .cue
# and the .json and silently dropped both .log files -- while the test that
# reads one kept passing, because the file was there untracked.
!docs/rig-*/*.log
.github/_build
.github/_install
__pycache__/
*.pyc
